Saniye Sher E Khuda Shah E Wafa Abul Fazl<br>
<br>
1. Tham Ke Tooti Kamr, Daude Shah E Behrobar<br>
Aayi Jo Teri Sada, Shah E Wafa....<br>
<br>
2. Khaime Me Mashk O Alam, Laye Jo Shah E Umam<br>
Hogya Shor E Buka, Shah E Wafa......<br>
<br>
3. Khoon Me Dooba Alam, Jab Huwe Bazu Qalam<br>
Pushte Faras Se Gira, Shah E Wafa...<br>
<br>
4. Laash Pa Teri Hussain, Aake Yeh Karte Hai Baain<br>
Chal Basa Bhai Mera, Shah E Wafa....<br>
<br>
5. Aayi Hai Zainab Hazeen, Karne Tera Arbayeen Nasir E Deen E<br>
Khuda, Shah E Wafa....